cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this repository, please cite the archived paper on Zenodo
  (see preferred-citation below).
title: >-
  The Pell Spine as an Optimal Rational Separator: Extremal Resolution and
  Smooth Transport in Primitive Pythagorean Triples
abstract: >-
  Computational supplement to the Zenodo manuscript of the same name. It
  reproduces the enumeration of primitive Pythagorean triples with hypotenuse
  at most 5x10^6, the exact record minima of the normalized separation
  Delta_k = (b - a)/c, and the Pell-spine recurrences. The paper is the
  primary scholarly record; this repository confirms its arithmetic claims.
